.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally on the MRP, it works as expected. Code looks good to me. I agree we should have a compatibility setting for this, but it's fine to have this new scaling enabled by default.\r\n\r\nHowever, on the [MSDF Font](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/gui/msdf_font) demo, this does not seem to resolve the issue where a MSDF font has greater line spacing than the same font with traditional rendering:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3dd83020-7125-4e28-bf44-497c3478b69e\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cb278d9-a864-4473-aaa4-0e2024cc6909\r\n\r\nI've also tested https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123159 and it didn't resolve this particular issue for me.\r\n\r\nI guess this is what this quote in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123159 refers to:\r\n\r\n> So there's one remaining issue not addressed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115 nor this PR, which is that depending on the MSDF size property, the vertical position of the glyph still changes significantly. I'm not aware of a bug report for it though.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115#pullrequestreview-5115034866","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123115","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-09-04T15:39:26Z"}]